    "text": "Let<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8477;</mi><mtext>&#160;and&#160;</mtext><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to"
